b0C, followed by postcuring at 120\u00b0C for 1 h. The effect of the stacking sequence of the laminates was analyzed in terms of the tensile, flexural, and impact properties. A chemical recycling was also performed and the mechanical properties of the recovered thermoplastic measured. POLYM. COMPOS., 39:E2217\u2013E2225, 2018. \u00a9 2017 Society of Plastics Engineers","author_count":7,"author_ids":["A5035654307","A5040128151","A5043760532","A5045345554","A5063415109","A5078348104","A5090078952"],"author_institution_ids":[],"authors":[{"id":"A5035654307","name":"Gianluca Cicala"},{"id":"A5078348104","name":"Salvatore Mannino"},{"id":"A5045345554","name":"Angela Daniela La Rosa"},{"id":"A5063415109","name":"D. Rey Banatao"},{"id":"A5043760532","name":"Stefan J. Pastine"},{"id":"A5040128151","name":"Szymon Kosi\u0144ski"},{"id":"A5090078952","name":"Fabrizio L. Scarpa"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":false,"cited_by_count":16,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.1002/pc.24582","domain_tags":[],"facet_tags":[],"institution_ids":["I36234482","I39063666"],"is_oa":false,"journal":"Polymer Composites","last_updated":"2026-11-07T11:25:07.637180","license":"","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"closed","oa_url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/pc.24582","openalex_topics":["T10513","T10810","T11145"],"plastic_related":true,"plastic_tier":"core","primary_topic":"T10513","pub_date":"2017-09-14","study_type":"article","title":"Hybrid biobased recyclable epoxy composites for mass production","type":"article","work_id":"W2755349950","year":2017}]}
